config BR2_PACKAGE_SC3336_T23
	bool "sc3336-t23"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_INGENIC_OPENSDK
	help
	  SmartSens SC3336 (3 MP, MIPI) sensor for Ingenic T23 on the
	  OpenIPC kernel, which ingenic-osdrv-t23 does not cover.

	  The driver source and the ISP tuning file (sc3336-t23.bin,
	  format 2.20, same as OpenIPC's other T23 tuning files) come
	  from thingino's ingenic-sdk (GPL-2.0+); only the includes are
	  changed so it builds against openingenic's ISP headers.

	  Installs sensor_sc3336_t23.ko, /etc/sensor/sc3336.yaml,
	  /etc/sensor/sc3336-t23.bin and its module options.

	  Ingenic's sensor prober (sinfo) does not know this chip, so the
	  device must set "fw_setenv sensor sc3336" for load_ingenic.
